        <p>
            We provide corporate car rental services across <strong>Davao City</strong>, including Poblacion, Buhangin, Lanang, Matina, and nearby business districts.
        </p>

        <h2 id="faq">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

        <h3>Do you offer long-term corporate car leasing?</h3>
        <p>Yes, we provide flexible long-term leasing options for companies needing daily or monthly vehicle use.</p>

        <h3>Can we request a dedicated driver for corporate use?</h3>
        <p>Yes, professional drivers are available for executive transport, meetings, and company events.</p>

        <h3>Do you provide corporate billing or monthly invoices?</h3>
        <p>Yes, we support corporate billing and can issue monthly statements for your company.</p>

        <h2 id="trust">Trusted by Davao Businesses</h2>
        <p>
            Our corporate clients include local companies, visiting executives, and organizations needing reliable business transport.
            We prioritize professionalism, punctuality, and comfort to support your business operations.
        </p>

        <h2 id="contact">Book Your Corporate Car Rental Today</h2>
        <p>
            Elevate your business operations with reliable transportation. Contact us to schedule your corporate rental or request a customized package.
